    "modifiedAt": "2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z"
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "pt_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -324
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Point tracker\n\nA field of dots drifts round a Lissajous path. Rasterize turns it into an image each frame, as a camera or video would be, and Point Tracker follows three points across it from the pixels alone (pyramidal Lucas–Kanade optical flow): it never sees the motion numbers. Each ring's colour is its `confidence` (green = locked on). Echo `trails` draw the paths.\n\nWire a Camera's image instead and set `points` on something with texture; `reset` starts again from `points`.",
        "width": 500,
        "height": 260
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Point tracker\n\nA field of dots drifts round a Lissajous path. Rasterize turns it into an image each frame, as a camera or video would be, and Point Tracker follows three points across it from the pixels alone (pyramidal Lucas–Kanade optical flow): it never sees the motion numbers. Each ring's colour is its `confidence` (green = locked on). Echo `trails` draw the paths.\n\nWire a Camera's image instead and set `points` on something with texture; `reset` starts again from `points`.",
        "width": 500,
        "height": 260
      }
    },
